            "review_title": "Review at Mễ - Mexican Fusion Bites",
            "review_text": "NorthStar32310434546\n2 contributions\n0\nMuy Bueno\nDec 2024 • Couples\nNever would have expected such delicious Mexican food in Hanoi. Cody did a fantastic job! We got the DIY burrito with pork, rice, sweet Mexi, chili corn mix, and tasty cheese. It was large and delicious! We also got the “Nice but weird fried” which were like nacho fries. It was all so very good! Wonderful job, Cody!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 27, 2024",
